  "instructions": [
    "Heat butter in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add chopped onions and cook until they are translucent.",
    "Add pav bhaji masala and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add chopped tomatoes and cook until they are soft.",
    "Add gherkin relish, salt, and water, and stir well.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the pav bhaji in ssam wraps with low-glycemic pav bhaji bread.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro or scallions, if desired."
